    <briefdescription>
<para>GL pipeline orchestrator — mirrors <ref refid="classjuce_1_1OpenGLAppComponent" kindref="compound" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/JUCE/docs/tagfile.xml">juce::OpenGLAppComponent</ref>. </para>
